WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
When Mr. Bilbo Baggins of Bag End announced that he would shortly be celebrating his eleventy-first birthday…

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
…with a party of special magnificence…

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Tents and tables were raised in the field by the great tree.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
…and there was much talk and excitement in Hobbiton.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Lanterns were lit one by one as evening fell.

00:30.000 --> 00:38.000
Then the sky above the Hill began to bloom.

00:38.000 --> 00:46.000
It was a party long remembered in Hobbiton.
